cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper below (preferred-citation) and this software."
type: software
title: "Code for: Transferring tuned configurations of continuous metaheuristics to subset selection"
abstract: >-
  Code of a parameter-swap study on maximum coverage: 25 continuous metaheuristics decoded to subset
  selection, their configurations tuned with irace on subset problems and on continuous benchmarks, the
  experiment runner, the follow-up parameter sets, and the scripts that produce the tables and figures
  of the paper.
